; IsaacRecomp mod. Turn it on or off with tools/mod_manager.html (or "mods =" in isaac.ini).
id = thegone
name = The Gone
version = 1.2
author = IsaacRecomp
description = A new character, in the spirit of Rebirth's The Lost: on the character select screen, one more place after the last character, with his card like the others' (name, stats, starting item). The Gone is a pale Isaac (3.5 damage, Isaac's speed) who starts with Spirit of the Night (he flies and his tears go through rocks; in the original game, Transcendence and the Ouija Board) and has no hearts at all: he can't pick up hearts of any kind, gain heart containers or extra lives, and the first hit kills him. In devil rooms he can take one deal for free, and then the other deals disappear. Random on the character select screen can pick him too.
